            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-12T18:21:39.058891+00:00",
            "notes": "Pick up [Multi-tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) and [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) for both paths. [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) can be a backup if you're short on cash (no CD reduction though). \n\nChoose your next item based on team comps, maps, and playstyles from Round 1.\n\n### Whip Shot Range\nFor enemy teams that are at range and/or to attack the backline more, take [Chain Extender](item_0a0d50dc-0ec9-42f6-a0ad-c373eb44dc6d). Try to hit targets as far away as possible to maximize burn damage. \n\n### Full Cooldown Reduction\nIf the enemy team is in close range, take [Mitzi's Medicine](item_382d3dbd-63b8-453f-9be3-fefc3600dd24) to maximize Whip Shot uptime. Approximately 4 second Whip Shots during this round. Play closer but still try to maximize Whip Shot distance. Make sure to use Packs regularly. \n\n### Power\nMany claim [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49) is impactful, but Arx doesn't feel it and opts for [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) on his second attempt.",
